          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rapid depletion of interceptors forces allied partners to prioritize resupply and allocation decisions, producing disputes and unequal burden‑sharing that erode operational and political alignment." />
