          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained external political commitment to large arms transfers translates into higher expected fiscal outlays, guarantees and contingent liabilities for supplier governments, increasing sovereign borrowing needs and term premia and lifting bond yields." />
