          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Increased political will to supply weapons driven by Russia‑Ukraine fighting accelerates deliveries of naval/anti-ship systems and training to regional partners, enabling more frequent and capable coercive deployments in the Strait of Hormuz." />
