          <attvalue for="32" value="+" />
          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="If actors securing the Strait of Hormuz can reliably control maritime traffic, they can facilitate covert maritime transfers of Iranian munitions and components to Russia (or to intermediaries supplying Russia), materially increasing Russia's capacity to conduct strikes that damage Ukrainian energy infrastructure." />
