          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rapid depreciation of an allied state's currency forces its government to divert budgetary resources to currency support and social stabilizers, producing domestic pressure to cut or delay allied contributions and generating disputes over burden‑sharing that reduce cohesion." />
