          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A weaker Russian ruble (a higher exchange-rate reading) raises the domestic cost of imported missiles, guidance systems and fuel, which tends to reduce Russian long‑range strike tempo and thus lowers the rate at which Ukrainian air‑defence interceptors are consumed." />
